---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — RBT Practice Exam"
  description="Simple and transparent Privacy Policy for rbtpracticeexam.xyz. Learn how we protect your privacy with zero-login access and private on-device study storage."
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 space-y-8 animate-fadeIn text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    
    {/* Page Header */}
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>Simple & Clear Privacy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        Last Updated: {lastUpdated} • <code>https://rbtpracticeexam.xyz</code>
      </p>
    </header>

    {/* Notice & Disclaimer */}
    <section class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-900/60 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-1.5">
      <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 uppercase tracking-wide text-xs">
        <span>Independent Study Platform Notice</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <strong>RBT Practice Exam</strong> is an independent educational website. We are <strong>not</strong> affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the Behavior Analyst Certification Board (BACB). RBT and BACB are registered trademarks used solely to describe the exam topics covered on this website.
      </p>
    </section>

    {/* Policy Sections in Plain Language */}
    <article class="space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      
      {/* 1. Zero Accounts */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          1. No Account or Sign-Up Required
        </h2>
        <p>
          You do not need to create an account, register a username, or provide an email address or password to use our website. All practice questions, mock exams, flashcards, and study tools are 100% free and open to everyone without signing in.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 2. How Your Progress is Saved */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          2. How Your Study Progress is Saved
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you practice questions, take mock exams, or review flashcards, your scores and progress are saved <strong>privately on your own device</strong> (inside your web browser).
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Scores & Answers:</strong> Saved only in your browser so you can see your personal scorecards and analytics.</li>
          <li><strong>Bookmarks:</strong> Saved only in your browser so you can review flagged questions later.</li>
          <li><strong>Dark / Light Theme:</strong> Remembers your display screen preference.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 pt-1">
          <strong>You Are in Full Control:</strong> We never collect or see your personal study scores on our servers. You can clear or reset your progress anytime by clicking "Reset Progress" on the Analytics page or by clearing your browser history.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 3. Cookies */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          3. No Tracking Cookies or Ads
        </h2>
        <p>
          We do not use tracking cookies, advertising trackers, or marketing profiling. We do not show third-party ads, and we do not track you across other websites.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 4. AI Study Tutor */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          4. AI Study Tutor
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you ask the AI Tutor to explain a practice question, only the text of the exam question and answer choices are sent to our AI service to generate a helpful explanation.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not send your name, email, or personal details to the AI provider. Please do not type any personal or private information into AI question boxes.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 5. We Do Not Sell Your Data */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          5. We Do Not Sell Your Information
        </h2>
        <p class="font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to anyone.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your information is never sold to marketing companies, advertisers, or third-party brokers.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 6. Security */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          6. Website Security
        </h2>
        <p>
          All pages on our website use secure encryption (HTTPS) to keep your browsing private and safe from tampering. We also use standard website security protections to prevent spam and automated attacks.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 7. Children's Privacy */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          7. Children's Privacy
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our study materials are intended for adults and students preparing for professional healthcare and behavior analysis certification. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 8. Contact Us */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          8. Contact Us
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how our website works, feel free to contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 text-sm space-y-1">
          <div><strong>Website:</strong> <code>https://rbtpracticeexam.xyz</code></div>
          <div><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@rbtpracticeexam.xyz" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 font-bold underline">support@rbtpracticeexam.xyz</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
